{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"拟仿射概形"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"拟仿射概形"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p><strong>拟仿射概形</strong> (quasi-affine scheme) 是满足如下等价条件的概形 $X$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$X$ "},{"Local":{"url":"拟紧概形","text":"拟紧"}},{"Plain":", 且同构于某个"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"开嵌入","text":"开子概形"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>典范的映射 $X\\to \\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathcal O_X(X))$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"拟紧态射","text":"拟紧"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"开嵌入","text":"开嵌入"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>对于拟仿射概形 $X$, 映射 $X\\to \\operatorname{Spec}(\\mathcal O_X(X))$ 称为 $X$ 的<strong>仿射闭包</strong> (affine closure), 满足\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Sch}}(X,\\operatorname{Spec}A)\r\n\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Aff}}(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_X(X),\\operatorname{Spec}A),\r\n$$\n它是"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射化"}},{"Plain":"的特例.</p>\n"}]}}